  "note": "Lunenburg Middle School -- page 130 is the LMS principal's report and the section heading on this page reads 'Special Ed. Middle School:'. Two columns, left x=0.100-0.105 and right x=0.371-0.375. TWO ENCODINGS ARE MIXED ON THIS PAGE. The left column prints names first-name-first with an occasional parenthesised role ('Ashley Parent (Speech)'). Parts of the right column print SURNAME FIRST ('Therrien, Nicole (PE)', 'Lizek, Maura 6th'); those names have been reordered for the 'name' field, as rule 4 permits, and role_raw is left exactly as printed including the parentheses. 'Jeri Sampson, Head Custodian' is NOT surname-first -- it is a name followed by a role, and is recorded that way. Line 5 prints 'Lori Shea (Psychologist' with no closing bracket; kept verbatim. Line 21's left heading is OCR'd 'Ith Grade:' and is carried verbatim into grade_or_dept for lines 22-26; from its position between '6th Grade:' and '8th Grade:' the reading is almost certainly '7th Grade:', which is not asserted. CONVENTION: a line holding a heading in one column and an entry in the other is listed under 'entries' only; lines 1, 7, 11, 14 and 21 are heading-only. Line 35 is the printed page number 129."
